# Build context of infra/images/app/Containerfile (podman reads this file too). Only sources and
# the lockfile go in; dependencies are installed inside the build. Every workspace package keeps its
# package.json in the context, so `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` sees the whole workspace.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.omc
.git
.github
docs
design-system
tools/assets/raw
playwright-report
test-results
# never send secrets into a build
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
infra/**/escrow
# npm / pnpm configuration may hold registry tokens; the build needs none of it.
**/.npmrc
